As a result, this Court finds that the case in hand squarely falls within the ambit and parameters settled by judicial precedents and hence, FIR No.203 dated 24.07.2018, under Section 420 of IPC;
Section 24 of Immigration Act and Section 13 of Punjab Prevention of Human Smuggling Act, 2012,
registered at Police Station Division No.6, Ludhiana along with consequential proceedings arising therefrom are hereby quashed qua the petitioner on the basis of compromise.
